   "ageDays": 0.01,
   "summary": "Unlock these with Subscription Jammu and Kashmir Chief Minister Omar Abdullah has married journalist Nidhi Razdan in New Delhi. 56-year-old Omar's marriage to his first wife, Payal, was dissolved by an order of the Supreme Court in July this year after the two reached a settlement. Mr. Abdullah's parents, Farooq Abdullah and Mollie, his three sisters, and other close relatives, as well as Ms. Nidhi's parents, veteran journalist M.K.",
   "summary_zh": "订阅即可解锁。查谟和克什米尔首席部长奥马尔·阿卜杜拉在新德里与记者尼迪·拉兹丹结婚。现年56岁的奥马尔与第一任妻子帕亚尔的婚姻，经双方达成和解后，于今年7月根据最高法院的裁决解除。阿卜杜拉先生的父母法鲁克·阿卜杜拉和莫莉、他的三个姐妹及其他近亲，以及尼迪女士的父母、资深记者M.K.",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Account subscription benefits alongside Premium Stories, Editorials, Opinions and more. Unlock these with Subscription Jammu and Kashmir Chief Minister Omar Abdullah has married journalist Nidhi Razdan in New Delhi. “A new journey began yesterday...\" Mr. Abdullah said in a post on X on Saturday (October 31, 2026) Sources said the marriage was solemnised under the Special Marriage Act in New Delhi on Friday (October 30, 2026). The witnesses included family members from both sides. 56-year-old Omar's marriage to his first wife, Payal, was dissolved by an order of the Supreme Court in July this year after the two reached a settlement. The wedding functions in Srinagar and New Delhi were attended by families and close relatives from both sides. Mr. Abdullah's parents, Farooq Abdullah and Mollie, his three sisters, and other close relatives, as well as Ms. Nidhi's parents, veteran journalist M.K. Razdan and Sarla Razdan, attended the functions. Comments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments. We have migrated to a new commenting platform. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles. If you do not have an account please register and login to post comments. Users can access their older comments by logging into their accounts on Vuukle",
