   "title": "Korean envoy to US vows support for bilateral investment at Hyundai's Alabama plant",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/companies/20261031/korean-envoy-to-us-vows-support-for-bilateral-investment-at-hyundais-alabama-plant",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
