   "title": "Gaon Cable wins $90 mil. cable order in US",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/companies/20261029/gaon-cable-wins-90-mil-cable-order-in-us",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "published": "Thu, 29 Oct 2026 02:42:03 GMT",
   "_dt": 1793241723.0,
   "ageDays": 2.38,
   "summary": "Gaon Cable, a Korean power cable maker, said Thursday it has secured a 120 billion-won ($90 million) cable supply deal with a U.S. cloud company. LS Cable USA (LSCUS), Gaon Cable's U.S. manufacturing subsidiary, will supply a medium-voltage power distribution cable system to the customer by the first half of next year, the company said in a press release.",
   "summary_zh": "韩国电缆制造商Gaon Cable周四表示，已与美国一家云服务公司敲定价值1200亿韩元（9000万美元）的电缆供应协议。该公司在新闻稿中表示，Gaon Cable的美国制造子公司LS Cable USA（LSCUS）将在明年上半年前向该客户供应一套中压配电电缆系统。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Gaon Cable, a Korean power cable maker, said Thursday it has secured a 120 billion-won ($90 million) cable supply deal with a U.S. cloud company. LS Cable USA (LSCUS), Gaon Cable's U.S. manufacturing subsidiary, will supply a medium-voltage power distribution cable system to the customer by the first half of next year, the company said in a press release. \"The order will support Gaon Cable's efforts to expand its presence in the North American artificial intelligence data center (AIDC) power infrastructure market,\" a company official said, adding that it plans to expand production and broaden its customer base. Gaon Cable is 81.62 percent owned by LS Cable & System, Korea's leading wire and cable manufacturer",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
   "country": [
    "kr"
   ],
   "topic": [
    "eco"
   ],
   "tier": 2,
   "actor": "美国",
   "alsoUS": false,
   "cnHit": false,
   "usHit": true,
   "terrHit": false,
   "riskHit": false,
   "riskKind": "",
   "score": 0.6,
   "tag": "rss_koreatimes",
   "title_zh": "Gaon Cable赢得美国价值9000万美元的电缆订单",
   "body_zh": "韩国电力电缆制造商Gaon Cable周四表示，已与美国一家云服务公司敲定价值1200亿韩元（9000万美元）的电缆供应协议。Gaon Cable的美国制造子公司LS Cable USA（LSCUS）将在明年上半年之前向该客户供应一套中压配电电缆系统。公司在一份新闻稿中表示了这一点。一名公司官员说：“这笔订单将支持Gaon Cable扩大其在北美人工智能数据中心（AIDC）电力基础设施市场的布局。”他还表示，公司计划扩大生产并拓宽客户群。Gaon Cable由韩国领先的电线电缆制造商LS Cable & System持有81.62%的股份。",
   "snippet_zh": ""
