   "title": "3 days to go! We are counting down to an event that promises new opportunities and fresh perspectives.",
   "url": "https://x.com/_chiefagbabiaka/status/2116083940897243340",
   "snippet": "3 days to go!\n\nWe are counting down to an event that promises new opportunities and fresh perspectives.\n\n@NACCIMA30 is taking Nigeria-China trade relations to a higher level.\n\nAt the NACCIMA-China B2B Investment Exchange 3.0 in Guanghzou, the Nigerian delegates will meet with several Chinese investors and business leaders to explore business and partnership opportunities.\n\nPriority sectors include:\n\n✅Agribusiness\n✅Mining and mineral processing\n✅Renewable energy\n✅Pharmaceuticals\n✅Automobiles\n✅Industrial park development \n✅ Among others",
